{"id":"c9aac9af8e42975f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/619_优先条件逻辑.md","title":"619 优先条件逻辑","display":"619_优先条件逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cond},\\quad\\operatorname{prio}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cond},\\quad\\operatorname{prio}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow_p B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\Rightarrow_p B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\prec B=\\operatorname{prio}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\prec B=\\operatorname{prio}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond},\\operatorname{prio}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond},\\operatorname{prio}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow_p B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A\\Rightarrow_p B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\prec B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A\\prec B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{619}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{619}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A\\Rightarrow_p B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A\\Rightarrow_p B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A\\prec B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A\\prec B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{619}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{619}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{619}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{619}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{619}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{619}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{619}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中替换扩张为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow_p B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow_p\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow_p B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow_p\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\prec B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\prec\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\prec B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\prec\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{619}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{619}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{619}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{619}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{619}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{619}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{619}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{619}(A)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{619}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{619}(A)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,619}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,619}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{619}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{619}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{619}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{619}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{619}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{619}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件与优先公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{619}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_p(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow_p B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{619}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow_p(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow_p B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrIr}^{619}\n=\n\\{\\neg(A\\prec A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrIr}^{619}\n=\n\\{\\neg(A\\prec A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrTrans}^{619}\n=\n\\{((A\\prec B)\\land(B\\prec C))\\to(A\\prec C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrTrans}^{619}\n=\n\\{((A\\prec B)\\land(B\\prec C))\\to(A\\prec C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrCond}^{619}\n=\n\\{((B\\prec C)\\land(A\\Rightarrow_p B))\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrCond}^{619}\n=\n\\{((B\\prec C)\\land(A\\Rightarrow_p B))\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{619}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{619}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrIr}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrTrans}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrCond}^{619}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{619}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{619}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrIr}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrTrans}^{619}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrCond}^{619}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{619}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{619}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{619}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow_p B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{619}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow_p B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{PrEq}^{619}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\prec C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\prec C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{PrEq}^{619}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\prec C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\prec C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{619}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{619}\\)</span> 为三者并。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{619}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{619}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{619}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{619}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{619}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{619}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{PrEq}^{619}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{PrEq}^{619}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的非空有限序列的集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{619}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{619}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的上述证明，其某行等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta,A)\">\\((\\Delta,A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{619}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{619}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{619}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{619}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{619}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{619}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{619}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{619}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{619}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{619}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{619}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{619}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{619}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{619}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{619}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{619}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{619}(A\\Rightarrow_p B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C)}\\;(RCK),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{619}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{619}(A\\prec C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\prec C)}\\;(PrEq).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{619}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{619}(A\\Rightarrow_p B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow_p C)}\\;(RCK),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{619}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{619}(A\\prec C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\prec C)}\\;(PrEq).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-优先条件语义\">8. 优先条件语义</h1>\n<p>优先条件模型为四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel},\\prec^{\\mathcal M})\\in\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel},\\prec^{\\mathcal M})\\in\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\prec^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(W)\\times\\mathcal P(W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\prec^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(W)\\times\\mathcal P(W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec^{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\prec^{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> 为集合载体上的严格偏序，并满足优先蕴含包含：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\subseteq W\\ \\neg(X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\subseteq W\\ \\neg(X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,Y,Z\\subseteq W\\ ((X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Y\\land Y\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Z)\n\\Rightarrow X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Z),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X,Y,Z\\subseteq W\\ ((X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Y\\land Y\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Z)\n\\Rightarrow X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Z),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,Y\\subseteq W\\ (X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Y\\Rightarrow X\\subseteq Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X,Y\\subseteq W\\ (X\\prec^{\\mathcal M}Y\\Rightarrow X\\subseteq Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第三条正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrCond}^{619}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrCond}^{619}\\)</span> 所需的模型约束。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\Rightarrow_p B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\Rightarrow_p B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\prec B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M},\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M})\\in\\prec^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\prec B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;(\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M},\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M})\\in\\prec^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{619}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{619}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{619}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{619}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel},\\prec^{\\mathcal M})\\in\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{619}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{619}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{619}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel},\\prec^{\\mathcal M})\\in\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{619}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{619}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统引入对象语言优先公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\prec B\">\\(A\\prec B\\)</span>，并用反自反、传递和条件提升公理约束它。第 8 节给出该构造子的集合优先语义；第 2 节中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\prec B\">\\(A\\prec B\\)</span> 仍是对象语言的二元公式构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>条件构造子与优先构造子都有独立的形成、自由变元、替换、公理与规则子句。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PrCond}_{619}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\operatorname{FV}_{619},\\operatorname{BV}_{619},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{619},\\operatorname{Sub}_{619},\\equiv_{\\alpha,619},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{619},\\mathsf{Rule}_{619},\\mathsf{Proof}_{619},\\operatorname{last}_{619},\n\\vdash_{619},\\mathsf{Thm}_{619},\\mathsf{Cert}_{619},\n\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{619},\\Vdash_{619},\\models_{619}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PrCond}_{619}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\operatorname{FV}_{619},\\operatorname{BV}_{619},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{619},\\operatorname{Sub}_{619},\\equiv_{\\alpha,619},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{619},\\mathsf{Rule}_{619},\\mathsf{Proof}_{619},\\operatorname{last}_{619},\n\\vdash_{619},\\mathsf{Thm}_{619},\\mathsf{Cert}_{619},\n\\mathsf{PrMod}_{619},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{619},\\Vdash_{619},\\models_{619}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由优先条件公式、公理、证明关系以及优先条件模型语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>本条目不在此处断言可靠性、完备性、优先模型表示定理或决策过程。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-优先条件语义","text":"8. 优先条件语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cond},\\quad\\operatorname{prio}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow_p B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B),","display":true},{"tex":"A\\prec B=\\operatorname{prio}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{619}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{619},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond},\\operator